<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 42.49 to 7,269.66.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite index fell 2.18 to 440.18.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell 21 cents.</p>
<p>Decliners outpaced advancers 1,322 to 1,150.</p>
<p>Volume was 466,692,430 compared with 526,968,910 on Tuesday.</p>
